note right of UC211
  **Add Stock Process:**
  
  1. Input: symbol, market
  2. Validate format (3-4 chars)
  3. Check if exists in DB
  4. Fetch from VnStock:
     - Company name
     - Exchange info
  5. Fetch 10 years OHLC data
  6. Bulk insert candlesticks
  7. Total time: ~10-30 seconds
end note

note right of UC213
  **Validation Rules:**
  
  Symbol:
  - Length: 3-4 characters
  - Format: Uppercase letters
  - No special characters
  
  Market:
  - HOSE, HNX, UPCOM (VN)
  - US (International)
  
  Duplicate Check:
  - Query: {symbol, market}
end note

note right of UC231
  **System Statistics:**
  
  Display:
  - Total stocks: 35
  - HOSE: 20
  - HNX: 8
  - UPCOM: 1
  - US: 6
  - Total candles: 125,000+
  - Last sync: 15:30 24/12/2025
  - RabbitMQ: Connected ✓
  - MongoDB: Healthy ✓
end note

note right of UC132
  **Watchlist Structure:**
  
  Collection: watchlists
  Document:
  {
    _id: ObjectId,
    userId: "user123",
    name: "My Portfolio",
    stocks: [
      {symbol: "VCB", market: "HOSE"},
      {symbol: "FPT", market: "HOSE"}
    ],
    createdAt: Date,
    updatedAt: Date
  }
end note

note right of UC101
  **News API:**
  
  Endpoint: /api/company/news/{symbol}
  Params: limit=20
  
  Response:
  - Title, subtitle
  - Summary (HTML stripped)
  - Image URL
  - Publish time
  - Price change %
  - Source link
  
  Source: VCI (vnstock_news)
end note

note bottom of UC111
  **Financial Reports:**
  
